{"id":28144,"author":"RainboW_SlimeY","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;Junior mod application\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eAge: 14\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eTimezone: Eastern\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have Teamspeak? yep\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have Discord? yep\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have access to a recording software? yep\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 1: SELF REFLECTION/EVALUATION\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eDo you have any experience as a moderator on other servers?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003eno i dont\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat is your biggest weakness and how will it affect your moderating?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003ei dont have many weaknesses but im sure trollers could find something to make me snap\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat qualities do you think a leader must have? Would you consider yourself a leader?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhy/why not?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003ea leader \u0026nbsp;should know how to handle alot of situations and know what to do at a certain time\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from other players that qualify you to be a moderator?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003ei dont rage, quit , take abuse of power, troll and am good at handle situations with trolls, hackers and other bad people.\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhat skills do you believe you should have when interacting with the community? Do you believe you have these skills?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003ebe able to take everyone seriously and make sure everyone can take you seriously, dont swear and or neglect other players. yes i believe i have these skills.\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat in your opinion are the three main character traits a moderator must have when moderating?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 2: GENERAL SITUATIONS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou notice a moderator giving out a lot of false bans. They almost always have insufficient evidence or sometimes no evidence and they don’t seem to care. You notice it but other staff members don’t. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003etell a higher staff depending on my rank and/or un ban all the players giving those players a warning depending on my rank.\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou are in Teamspeak with a few other players and they begin talking quite disrespectfully about a particular staff member. You agree with what they’re saying to an extent, but the conversation starts to become racial and very disrespectful soon after. You are all in a nightclub channel where this is allowed. What would you do?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003ebecause this is allowed in this channel i cannot do much but leave and tell the other staff to ignore it.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou are in an Avicus team. One of your teammates is also an Avicus Staff member. One day in your team discord the team member/staff member posts a screenshot of a thread that only staff members can see. The content in the screenshot isn’t very important/confidential but only staff members could see it on the forums. If anything, what would you do?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eask the staff why make it so only staff could see it and take there answer into account.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eSome senior staff members are in teamspeak joking around with each other. They are removing others ranks, creating certain channels and even harassing certain users. They don’t mean any harm but some players in the channel feel a bit angry that they are using their permissions the way they are. What would you do?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eundo anything the senior staff do and tell a higher ranked staff to fix the problem depending on my rank. if i was higher rank then the senior staff i would take away there privleges till the highestranked staff says what to do.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 3: OTHER\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; text-decoration-line: underline;\"\u003eNOTE: This is a new criteria and these questions are less to do with right/wrong answer and more to do with us getting to know you. Please answer these honestly. There is no right or wrong answer.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhy do you want to be a moderator?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003ei play nebula alot and there are so many trolls and some hackers that should be taken care of, also i would love to be part of the avicus staff\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhat does Avicus mean to you?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003eavicus is my favorite minecraft server and i have played it alot over all the minecraft servers i have ever been on\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eAnything specific the staff team could do better?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eno not much i can think of other then adding me to the team\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhy did you choose to apply at Avicus?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003ei play avicus 10 times more then all my other servers\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eDo you have anything else to add to your application?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003enot much other then i will be starting a mc utube channel and avicus will be 9/10 the server i play on\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;Junior mod application\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eAge: 14\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eTimezone: Eastern\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have Teamspeak? yep\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have Discord? yep\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have access to a recording software? yep\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 1: SELF REFLECTION/EVALUATION\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eDo you have any experience as a moderator on other servers?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003eno i dont\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat is your biggest weakness and how will it affect your moderating?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003ei dont have many weaknesses but im sure trollers could find something to make me snap\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat qualities do you think a leader must have? Would you consider yourself a leader?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhy/why not?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003ea leader \u0026nbsp;should know how to handle alot of situations and know what to do at a certain time\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from other players that qualify you to be a moderator?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003ei dont rage, quit , take abuse of power, troll and am good at handle situations with trolls, hackers and other bad people.\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhat skills do you believe you should have when interacting with the community? Do you believe you have these skills?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003ebe able to take everyone seriously and make sure everyone can take you seriously, dont swear and or neglect other players. yes i believe i have these skills.\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat in your opinion are the three main character traits a moderator must have when moderating?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 2: GENERAL SITUATIONS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou notice a moderator giving out a lot of false bans. They almost always have insufficient evidence or sometimes no evidence and they don’t seem to care. You notice it but other staff members don’t. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003etell a higher staff depending on my rank and/or un ban all the players giving those players a warning depending on my rank.\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou are in Teamspeak with a few other players and they begin talking quite disrespectfully about a particular staff member. You agree with what they’re saying to an extent, but the conversation starts to become racial and very disrespectful soon after. You are all in a nightclub channel where this is allowed. What would you do?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003ebecause this is allowed in this channel i cannot do much but leave and tell the other staff to ignore it.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou are in an Avicus team. One of your teammates is also an Avicus Staff member. One day in your team discord the team member/staff member posts a screenshot of a thread that only staff members can see. The content in the screenshot isn’t very important/confidential but only staff members could see it on the forums. If anything, what would you do?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eask the staff why make it so only staff could see it and take there answer into account.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eSome senior staff members are in teamspeak joking around with each other. They are removing others ranks, creating certain channels and even harassing certain users. They don’t mean any harm but some players in the channel feel a bit angry that they are using their permissions the way they are. What would you do?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eundo anything the senior staff do and tell a higher ranked staff to fix the problem depending on my rank. if i was higher rank then the senior staff i would take away there privleges till the highestranked staff says what to do.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 3: OTHER\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; text-decoration-line: underline;\"\u003eNOTE: This is a new criteria and these questions are less to do with right/wrong answer and more to do with us getting to know you. Please answer these honestly. There is no right or wrong answer.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhy do you want to be a moderator?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003ei play nebula alot and there are so many trolls and some hackers that should be taken care of, also i would love to be part of the avicus staff\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhat does Avicus mean to you?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003eavicus is my favorite minecraft server and i have played it alot over all the minecraft servers i have ever been on\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eAnything specific the staff team could do better?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eno not much i can think of other then adding me to the team\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhy did you choose to apply at Avicus?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003ei play avicus 10 times more then all my other servers\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eDo you have anything else to add to your application?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003enot much other then i will be starting a mc utube channel and avicus will be 9/10 the server i play on\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","created_at":1503161186,"title":"junior mod application","replies":[{"id":379472,"author":"BoldAndBrash","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e[Denied]\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- I am sorry to say your application has been denied for:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eLack of detail\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eLack of proper capitalization, punctuation, and spelling\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou may submit ONE more application.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e[Denied]\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- I am sorry to say your application has been denied for:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eLack of detail\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003eLack of proper capitalization, punctuation, and spelling\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;